      "description": "One square per method, with a full readable list in the live dashboard. Illustrative marks only.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-map\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Illustrative method states: passed, failed, pending, excluded, unverified\"><span class=\"ds-cell ds-passed\" title=\"Passed\"></span><span class=\"ds-cell ds-failed\" title=\"Failed\"></span><span class=\"ds-cell ds-pending\" title=\"Pending\"></span><span class=\"ds-cell ds-excluded\" title=\"Excluded\"></span><span class=\"ds-cell ds-unverified\" title=\"Unverified\"></span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-map{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(6px,1fr));gap:3px;max-height:180px;overflow:auto;margin-top:21px;padding:1px}.ds-cell{aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:1px;min-width:0;min-height:5px}.ds-passed{background:var(--pass,#85e3bd)}.ds-failed{background:var(--fail,#ff9b90)}.ds-pending{background:var(--pending,#455c6a)}.ds-excluded{background:var(--excluded,#8a7b9c)}.ds-unverified{background:var(--unverified,#e9c875)}"
